144300 6-CALL-CMANINQ.
           IF PRT-EST-COST = SPACES MOVE ZEROES TO P-EST-COST.
           IF PRT-ACT-COST = SPACES MOVE ZEROES TO P-ACT-COST.
           IF PRT-EST-QTY = SPACES MOVE ZEROES TO PRT-EST-QTY-9.
           IF PRT-ACT-QTY = SPACES MOVE ZEROES TO PRT-ACT-QTY-9.
144400     IF PRT-REQ-NO = SPACES OR "CANCEL" GO TO 6-CC-EXIT.
144500     MOVE SPACES TO CMR-DATA CMR-DESC CMR-REMARKS
144600         CMR-RETURNED-DATA CMR-REMARKS BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
144700     MOVE PRT-REQ-NO TO CMR-REQ-NUMBER.
144800     MOVE PRT-WO-NU TO CMR-WO-NUMBER.
144900     MOVE "IN" TO CMR-CALL-MODE.
